{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>These are the appointed times.</b> Scripture restored it because of Atzeret, concerning which והקרבתם אשה was not stated; this verse comes and states concerning all the appointed times — להקריב אשה לה׳. And also, since והקרבתם אשה was not stated concerning Shabbat, it says here: מלבד שבתות ה׳." "<b>To offer an offering to HaShem.</b> Olah and minhah, zevach and libations — in all of them there are olah and minhah, zevach and libations. And when it mentions zevach, all the offerings are included, for just as the communal shelamim are eaten by the priests, so the sin-offerings of the appointed times are eaten by the priests."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "Reading אהדריה קרא as Aramaic 'Scripture restored it,' referring to the reiteration of the festival calendar; Atzeret here refers to Shemini Atzeret."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:44.232650118Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}